2026-07-27T06:04:21.0219810Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T06:04:21.0220356Z i /tmp/RtmpzQ8smS/duckdb
2026-07-27T06:04:21.0220730Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T06:04:21.0221319Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T06:04:21.0222069Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T06:04:21.0222684Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T06:04:21.0223546Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T06:04:21.0224223Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T06:04:21.0401263Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T06:04:21.0480232Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T06:04:21.0799434Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T06:04:21.0919512Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
